@startuml
|User|
start
:Enter current password, new password, and confirm password;
:Submit change password request;

|ChangePasswordPage|
:Receive change password request;
:Send data to SessionController;

|PasswordController|
:Validate current password;
if (Current password valid?) then (yes)
    :Update password in Database;
    :Notify success to ChangePasswordPage;
    |EmailService|
    :Send password change notification;
else (no)
    :Notify failure to ChangePasswordPage;
endif

|ChangePasswordPage|
if (Password change successful?) then (yes)
    :Show success message;
else (no)
    :Show error message;
endif
end
@enduml
